## Folder Explanation

# client/
React frontend (Presentation Layer)
Handles:
- Emotion selection UI
- Displaying shlok & guidance
- Community counter
- Feedback system
# server/
Backend (Application + AI Layer)
Handles
- Emotion classification
- LLM API calls
- Shlok retrieval
- JWT authentication
- Feedback storage
# database/
Contains curated Bhagavad Gita shlok dataset.
# docs/



